Stakeholder Group	Role & Primary Business Responsibilities
Front Office Trading Desks

(Rates, FX & FX Options, Commodities, Credit)	• Execute real-time pre-deal checks in the Trade Pad before booking.

• Evaluate incremental XVA risk charges.

• Pass XVA costs to clients via trade margins/spreads where applicable.
PCVA Desk

(Pricing, Capital Valuations & Adjustments)	• Manage bank-wide XVA risk and receive trade-level XVA broker flows.

• Monitor EOD book-level CVA/FVA provisions and sensitivities.

• Execute market hedges using Credit Default Swaps (CDS) and ITRAXX indices.
Product Control Valuations

(Finance)	• Validate daily End-of-Day CVA/FVA provision figures.

• Perform multi-iteration P&L Explain reporting to isolate day-over-day risk factor impacts.
Risk Oversight	• Track and monitor bank-wide XVA risk sensitivities.
Downstream Risk & Capital Teams	• Rex (Risk Explorer): Consumes market risk sensitivities.

• GTRS: Consumes exposure data for regulatory capital calculations.
